<title>SPAIN: Repsol signs pact with Spanish utilities.</title>
<headline>Repsol signs pact with Spanish utilities.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Repsol, Gas Natural and Iberdrola have signed an accord which lays the ground for greater co-operation between the three companies, Repsol said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Under the agreement the three will co-operate up to 50 percent in new energy production projects relating to cogeneration, electricity production using natural gas or refinery residues.</p>
<p>In addition, the accord covers collaboration in overseas energy projects, particularly in Latin America, and the acquisition of gas reserves to ensure supplies for any new power plants constructed.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom + 34 1 585 2161</p>
